{"id":"db8da4f25311c498","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-gl-decomposition.md","title":"GL Decomposition Lemma","display":"lem-gl-decomposition — GL Decomposition Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-gl-decomposition","aliases":["89-lem-gl-decomposition"],"display":"lem-gl-decomposition — GL Decomposition Lemma","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-normal-form]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-modal-sequent]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-gl-decomposition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-gl-decomposition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-gl-decomposition — GL Decomposition Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b3c8928cef7eaa4\" href=\"?note=0b3c8928cef7eaa4\" title=\"89-df-gl-normal-form\">89-df-gl-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca21b68a25f1afc2\" href=\"?note=ca21b68a25f1afc2\" title=\"89-df-modal-sequent\">89-df-modal-sequent</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is the modal-literal class.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decomposition}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\n\\exists(\\Gamma_i)_{i&lt;m}\\in\n(\\mathcal L_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega})^{m}\\;\n\\left[\nA\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigvee\\langle\\bigwedge\\Gamma_i\\mid i&lt;m\\rangle\n\\right]\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decomposition}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\n\\exists(\\Gamma_i)_{i&lt;m}\\in\n(\\mathcal L_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega})^{m}\\;\n\\left[\nA\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigvee\\langle\\bigwedge\\Gamma_i\\mid i&lt;m\\rangle\n\\right]\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>GL 分解引理把最外层盒公式当作命题原子并应用析取范式</li>\n<li>GL分解引理是完全性证明的核心</li>\n<li>GL分解引理简化模态证明</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_i\">\\(\\Gamma_i\\)</span> 是模态文字的有限序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge,\\bigvee\">\\(\\bigwedge,\\bigvee\\)</span> 使用\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca21b68a25f1afc2\" href=\"?note=ca21b68a25f1afc2\" title=\"89-df-modal-sequent\">89-df-modal-sequent</a> 的空序列约定；因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 两个边界\n情形也包含在陈述中。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"0b3c8928cef7eaa4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"ca21b68a25f1afc2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-sequent]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"ca21b68a25f1afc2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma_i$ 是模态文字的有限序列，$\\bigwedge,\\bigvee$ 使用\n[[89-df-modal-sequent]] 的空序列约定；因此 $\\top$、$\\bot$ 两个边界\n情形也包含在陈述中。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decomposition}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\n\\exists(\\Gamma_i)_{i<m}\\in\n(\\mathcal L_{\\Box}^{<\\omega})^{m}\\;\n\\left[\nA\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigvee\\langle\\bigwedge\\Gamma_i\\mid i<m\\rangle\n\\right]\\in\\mathrm{GL}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge,\\bigvee","display":false},{"tex":"\\top","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false}],"bytes":1133,"backlinks":[{"id":"588e8fcba7d283dc","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["0b3c8928cef7eaa4","0006800fa1c85177","ca21b68a25f1afc2"]}